From 2211cae23b90a2a5f2a1eefabe84ae4538d7f29a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: song <songyiqiang1994@163.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 14:37:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Introduce hdr_histogram dependency for
 command-latency-tracking

Backport hdr_histogram (C-based HdrHistogram library) from Redis 7.2.11.

deps/hdr_histogram/ (10 files):
  Core: hdr_histogram.c, hdr_histogram.h, hdr_atomic.h
  Redis integration: hdr_redis_malloc.h (zmalloc wrapper)
  Build: Makefile (-std=c99, -DHDR_MALLOC_INCLUDE)
  Docs/tests: COPYING, LICENSE, README, hdr_tests.h

hdr_redis_malloc.h is adapted for older Redis versions without
zcalloc_num() by providing a static inline wrapper over zcalloc().

src/Makefile: DEPENDENCY_TARGETS, include path, link hdr_histogram.o
deps/Makefile: build target, clean rule, .PHONY marker
